From f3a3b26c4d842f51f09d4b32f6b1eea1481fe1db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bezko <bezkom@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 04:20:52 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Cycle strip meter type Peak/K14.
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Ctrl+click the mixer meter toggles Route MeterPeak↔MeterK14. Pk/K14
badge under the meter; read_meters honors the active type.
---
